! Basin-hopping input taken from the Wales group LJ38 introduction
! (examples/LJ38/01_Introducing_GMIN/input/data). The same file is used
! at every size. STEPS is long so the evaluator cap in H2H_BUDGET is
! the stop. The driver appends one RANSEED line per run.
! MONITOR, DUMPINT and TRACKDATA are omitted. They schedule output.

SLOPPYCONV 5.0D-3
TIGHTCONV 1.0D-3
EDIFF 0.003
MAXIT 600 500
SAVE 2
CENTRE
SORT

TEMPERATURE 1.0
STEPS 90000000 1.0
STEP 0.40 0.51
NEWRESTART 40
AVOID 4.0 20 F
